---
source: tests/render.rs
expression: "built(\"notes/syntax\")"
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="dark light">
<link rel="manifest" href="/.tachylite/app.webmanifest">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/.tachylite/style.css">
<meta name="tachylite-version" content="415c3767137e8439">
<title>Syntax tour</title>
<script src="/.tachylite/live.js" defer></script>
</head>
<body>
<header><a href="/">Home</a><a href="/.tachylite/recent">Recent</a><button type="button" class="find" title="Find a note (Ctrl-K)">Find</button></header>
<main>
<nav class="crumbs"><a href="/.tachylite/folders/notes">notes</a></nav>
<dl class="properties"><dt>title</dt><dd>Syntax tour</dd><dt>aliases</dt><dd>tour</dd><dt>tags</dt><dd><a class="tag" href="/.tachylite/tags/sample">#sample</a></dd></dl>
<h1 id="syntax-tour-heading">Syntax <a class="tag" href="/.tachylite/tags/tour-heading">#tour-heading</a></h1>
<div class="callout" data-callout="warning" data-callout-fold="none">
<div class="callout-title">
Mind the <em>step</em>
</div>
<div class="callout-content">
<p>A callout with a title.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="callout" data-callout="tip" data-callout-fold="collapsed">
<div class="callout-title">
Folded
</div>
<div class="callout-content">
<p>Hidden until opened.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div class="callout" data-callout="custom-kind" data-callout-fold="none">
<div class="callout-title">Custom kind</div>
<div class="callout-content">
<p>A custom type.</p>
</div>
</div>
<p>Some <mark>highlighted</mark> text, a  comment, and tags <a class="tag" href="/.tachylite/tags/garden">#garden</a> and <a class="tag" href="/.tachylite/tags/plants/fern">#plants/fern</a>.</p>
<p>A footnote.<sup class="footnote-ref"><a href="#fn-1" id="fnref-1" data-footnote-ref>1</a></sup></p>
<pre class="mermaid">graph TD
%% a Mermaid comment stays
A--&gt;B
</pre>
<section class="footnotes" data-footnotes>
<ol>
<li id="fn-1">
<p>The footnote text. <a href="#fnref-1" class="footnote-backref" data-footnote-backref data-footnote-backref-idx="1" aria-label="Back to reference 1">↩</a></p>
</li>
</ol>
</section>
</main>
</body>
</html>
